# Parallelization level above 100 is rejected

A level above 100 is outside the supported range and must fail before execution.

>>> source
@config { parallelization: { level: 101 } }

<<< stdout

<<< stderr
eck: invalid value for configuration `parallelization.level`: parallelization.level must be an integer from 0 through 100 at Span { start: 36, end: 39 }

<<< exit
1
